<title>BELGIUM: Italy ERM talks still open - Spanish officials.</title>
<headline>Italy ERM talks still open - Spanish officials.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish monetary officials said on Saturday that the outcome of the European Union's talks on the Italian lira rejoining the exchange rate mechanism was still up in the air.</p>
<p>&quot;It's very open,&quot; one official said during a break from the meeting.  </p>
<p>The officials said the meeting had gone around the table on the issue with each delegation expressing its opinion and that talks were taking place between various countries.</p>
<p>They would not comment further. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
